---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="parking" class="py-20 sm:py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="text-center mb-14">
    <p class="section-eyebrow mb-3">Getting Here</p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-navy mb-4">
      Parking Information
    </h2>
    <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-sunset rounded-full mx-auto mb-4"></div>
    <p class="text-navy/60 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Everything you need to know about parking near the Baywalk.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Main Card -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-sand-warm/50">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-palm/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
          <Icon name="car" size={24} class="text-palm" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-xl text-navy">Street Parking</h3>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-navy/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-palm mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
          <span><strong class="text-navy">Free street parking</strong> available along Sandoval Street and adjacent roads.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-palm mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
          <span>Parking is <strong class="text-navy">first-come, first-served</strong> — no reservations.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-palm mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
          <span>Spaces fill up quickly during <strong class="text-navy">sunset hours (5:00–7:00 PM)</strong> and weekends.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-palm mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold">&#10003;</span>
          <span>Park at your own risk — <strong class="text-navy">don't leave valuables visible</strong> in your car.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Tips Card -->
    <div class="bg-navy text-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gold/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
          <Icon name="info" size={24} class="text-gold-light" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-xl">Parking Tips</h3>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-gold mt-0.5 shrink-0">&#9679;</span>
          <span><strong class="text-white">Arrive before 5 PM</strong> for the best parking spots close to the Baywalk entrance.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-gold mt-0.5 shrink-0">&#9679;</span>
          <span><strong class="text-white">Designated areas</strong> near the Immaculate Conception Cathedral offer additional spaces (5-min walk).</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-gold mt-0.5 shrink-0">&#9679;</span>
          <span><strong class="text-white">Tricycle / walking</strong> is often easier — if you're staying in the city center, the Baywalk is within walking distance.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-gold mt-0.5 shrink-0">&#9679;</span>
          <span><strong class="text-white">Motorcycle parking</strong> is much easier to find than car parking.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-gold mt-0.5 shrink-0">&#9679;</span>
          <span>Nearby hotels (like Hue Hotels or Aziza Paradise) have <strong class="text-white">paid parking</strong> if street parking is full.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
